&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience launching agentic and/or generative AI products —&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;shipped messaging and GTM for AI-native capabilities and can speak credibly about agents, models, and the realities of selling AI into the enterprise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Start-up DNA:&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;thrived in early-stage or fast-scaling environments, have a real can-do attitude, and genuinely enjoy building from scratch and&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;in ambiguity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep experience partnering with product leadership and PMs, paired with a genuine passion for testing and iterating on products and features.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;re&amp;nbsp;hands-on with the product, opinionated about it, and rigorous about&amp;nbsp;validating&amp;nbsp;what&#39;s working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
